                    {
                        "form_id": "cdc53143-3cd4-41c6-b55e-f65c4d9ac618",
                        "entry_id": "972caa9b-74d6-327a-8b75-4042a1e0fd20",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "ветри́лах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8dda4dce-caec-38d2-80e5-d8224c15096e",
                        "entry_id": "972caa9b-74d6-327a-8b75-4042a1e0fd20",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар., поэт. то же, что парус"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec2dc7ee-99f1-4fc1-86f1-0994e996236e",
                                "sense_id": "8dda4dce-caec-38d2-80e5-d8224c15096e",
                                "text": "Шуми, шуми, послушное ветрило, // Волнуйся подо мной, угрюмый океан. // Лети, корабль."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf439b0c-73d7-402a-83d8-c20780a33c54",
                                "sense_id": "8dda4dce-caec-38d2-80e5-d8224c15096e",
                                "text": "На воздушном океане, // Без руля и без ветрил, // Тихо плавают в тумане // Хоры стройные светил."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e71fe43-cbd2-4ba2-9583-6ce1d30ee9b3",
                                "sense_id": "8dda4dce-caec-38d2-80e5-d8224c15096e",
                                "text": "Громады скал у берегов, // В клочки изорвано ветрило… // Таких немало челноков // Без цели море погубило."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a0c069bd-6b2c-37f0-8baf-3009457c07a7",
                        "entry_id": "972caa9b-74d6-327a-8b75-4042a1e0fd20",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг., увелич. к ветер; сильный, резкий ветер"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ea74085-9cba-48e8-85dd-10d8f2ee5fbb",
                                "sense_id": "a0c069bd-6b2c-37f0-8baf-3009457c07a7",
                                "text": "Зонтом мы укрываемся, // а дождь сечёт нас розгами, // и подгоняет лодочку ветрило продувной."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "70993cd5-7d81-4d28-a6a5-2d01d16e3632",
                                "sense_id": "a0c069bd-6b2c-37f0-8baf-3009457c07a7",
                                "text": "— И что это за ветрило у вас тут такой бешеный, — пожаловалась Литвейко. // — А это норд, — ответила Ася. — Помнишь, какой нас в море трепал?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "10c2f239-ddd5-497c-b17b-b55b946b0e23",
                        "source_entry_id": "972caa9b-74d6-327a-8b75-4042a1e0fd20",
                        "target_lang_word": "sail",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sail",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86d6ee8a-4ac4-3a12-861f-dec4057fe752",
                                        "entry_id": "862123a9-e922-31cc-86fb-49ab4d621e8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A piece of fabric attached to a boat and arranged such that it causes the wind to drive the boat along. The sail may be attached to the boat via a combination of mast, spars and ropes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19bb43c9-4531-47a0-95e9-ada1ff00f07f",
                                                "sense_id": "86d6ee8a-4ac4-3a12-861f-dec4057fe752",
                                                "text": "When we haue laught to ſee the ſailes conceiue / And grow big bellied with the wanton winde; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3907673-334b-39c4-aaee-d1c1ca7b2882",
                                        "entry_id": "862123a9-e922-31cc-86fb-49ab4d621e8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The concept of a sail or sails, as if a substance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6779e25d-b5af-47ac-91e2-f8bfc615a79b",
                                                "sense_id": "c3907673-334b-39c4-aaee-d1c1ca7b2882",
                                                "text": "Take in sail: a storm is coming."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8773785-9226-34a7-bc8c-91637222533f",
                                        "entry_id": "862123a9-e922-31cc-86fb-49ab4d621e8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The power harnessed by a sail or sails, or the use of this power for travel or transport."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38120305-553a-344b-92ef-499777e35589",
                                        "entry_id": "862123a9-e922-31cc-86fb-49ab4d621e8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A trip in a boat, especially a sailboat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1955e910-a6ac-4343-929e-f1f18c098a9d",
                                                "sense_id": "38120305-553a-344b-92ef-499777e35589",
                                                "text": "Let's go for a sail."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b14a3d5f-401f-3d0d-8790-56509c8d4ec0",
                                        "entry_id": "862123a9-e922-31cc-86fb-49ab4d621e8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sailing vessel; a vessel of any kind; a craft."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3398756-2d57-4618-affd-6be39bbb6b18",
                                                "sense_id": "b14a3d5f-401f-3d0d-8790-56509c8d4ec0",
                                                "text": "Twenty sail were in sight."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f58cd6f-07c4-4654-808e-742196108312",
                                                "sense_id": "b14a3d5f-401f-3d0d-8790-56509c8d4ec0",
                                                "text": "\"[…] The quay is upwards of 1,000 feet in length, and capable of accommodating more than 100 sail of traders; and there are generally a considerable number of vessels of from 40 to 300 tons burden, from various parts of the world, waiting to receive their cargoes.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d299fb1f-38be-399e-9128-9f6d8e469e9e",
                                        "entry_id": "862123a9-e922-31cc-86fb-49ab4d621e8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The conning tower of a submarine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b81ac13-0185-32f7-a77a-3ee6fedc3942",
                                        "entry_id": "862123a9-e922-31cc-86fb-49ab4d621e8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The blade of a windmill."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64858105-3ea3-4d94-9615-86ef32688a47",
                                                "sense_id": "0b81ac13-0185-32f7-a77a-3ee6fedc3942",
                                                "text": "So furious had been the gusts, that high buildings in town had had the lead stripped off their roofs; and in the country, trees had been torn up, and sails of windmills carried away; and gloomy accounts had come in from the coast, of shipwreck and death."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "596c3fbe-bb02-38c2-964f-7541ae848347",
                                        "entry_id": "862123a9-e922-31cc-86fb-49ab4d621e8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tower-like structure found on the dorsal (topside) surface of submarines."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82e47379-3711-3502-8f09-4fddd48f9b6b",
                                        "entry_id": "862123a9-e922-31cc-86fb-49ab4d621e8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The floating organ of siphonophores, such as the Portuguese man-of-war."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6f923ed-5c95-3415-a176-8dcd62e0f42a",
                                        "entry_id": "862123a9-e922-31cc-86fb-49ab4d621e8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sailfish."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95133849-5c80-4cf4-8ed9-29215ccca102",
                                                "sense_id": "a6f923ed-5c95-3415-a176-8dcd62e0f42a",
                                                "text": "We caught three sails today."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1de8b61-5735-345b-a3db-592fc38f6365",
                                        "entry_id": "862123a9-e922-31cc-86fb-49ab4d621e8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "an outward projection of the spine, occurring in certain dinosaurs and synapsids"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d86af44d-96c1-3e8c-b896-25d72ad5bc8a",
                                        "entry_id": "862123a9-e922-31cc-86fb-49ab4d621e8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything resembling a sail, such as a wing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b549e70a-6794-46bf-91d1-5b87ed723b82",
                                                "sense_id": "d86af44d-96c1-3e8c-b896-25d72ad5bc8a",
                                                "text": "Like an eagle […]soaring / / To weather his broad sails."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
